node_modules/
lib/
dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Scratch directories a human (or an agent) may leave behind while restoring a
# profile: they hold LOCAL state, not repo sources, and must never be committed.
# Without this rule `git add -A` picks them up — which is how a 94 KB snapshot
# of the machine's `cordis.patch.yml` once landed in a release commit.
.tmp-restore/
.tmp-*/

# Manual backups of machine-local state (registry exports, device dumps, driver
# backups). They describe THIS computer — usernames, instance IDs, serial-ish
# values — so they must never reach the repo. Same reason as above: `git add -A`
# is the usual way they leak in. See docs/PRIVACY.md.
_backup_*/
backup-local/
*.reg

# Windows 保留设备名：MSYS 会把 `CON` 之类映射成字符设备节点，
# 它们不是真文件（删不掉，也不该出现在 `git status` 里）。
CON
PRN
AUX
NUL
COM1
COM2
COM3
LPT1
